<!doctype html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Maison Rivea | Immobilier prive Cote d'Azur</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Demo de site premium pour une maison immobiliere privee sur la Cote d'Azur.">
  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #121418;
      --muted: #5f6670;
      --line: #dde1e6;
      --paper: #fbfaf7;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --gold: #b89555;
      --forest: #18352f;
      --night: #0e1618;
      --soft: #f1eee7;
      --radius: 8px;
      --shadow: 0 22px 60px rgba(11, 17, 20, .18);
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--paper);
      color: var(--ink);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    img {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }

    .nav {
      position: fixed;
      z-index: 30;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 28px;
      min-height: 76px;
      padding: 18px clamp(18px, 5vw, 64px);
      color: var(--white);
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0, 0, 0, .58), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0));
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0;
      letter-spacing: .18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .brand span {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.72);
      letter-spacing: .09em;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 26px;
      align-items: center;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.84);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--white); }

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 46px;
      padding: 0 20px;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: .02em;
      transition: transform .2s ease, background .2s ease, border .2s ease;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }

    .btn-light {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.95);
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    .btn-dark {
      background: var(--night);
      color: var(--white);
    }

    .btn-outline {
      border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.52);
      color: var(--white);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }

    .hero {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 92vh;
      display: grid;
      align-items: end;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #0c1113;
    }

    .hero-media {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
    }

    .hero-media::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background:
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(2, 7, 9, .80), rgba(2, 7, 9, .32) 46%, rgba(2, 7, 9, .18)),
        linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(2, 7, 9, .76), rgba(2, 7, 9, 0) 48%);
    }

    .hero-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      max-width: 820px;
      padding: 150px clamp(18px, 5vw, 64px) 88px;
      color: var(--white);
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: #d8c08b;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .18em;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    h1, h2, h3, p { margin-top: 0; }

    h1 {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-size: clamp(48px, 8vw, 112px);
      line-height: .92;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 620px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.82);
      font-size: clamp(17px, 2vw, 21px);
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .metrics {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 3;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 1px;
      margin: -48px clamp(18px, 5vw, 64px) 0;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.24);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .metric {
      min-height: 118px;
      padding: 24px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.96);
    }

    .metric strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-size: 34px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--forest);
    }

    .metric span {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .section {
      padding: clamp(70px, 10vw, 118px) clamp(18px, 5vw, 64px);
    }

    .section-head {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: end;
      gap: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 34px;
    }

    .section h2 {
      max-width: 680px;
      margin-bottom: 0;
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 62px);
      line-height: 1;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    .section-head p {
      max-width: 390px;
      margin-bottom: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .properties {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 22px;
    }

    .property {
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 14px 34px rgba(13, 22, 26, .08);
    }

    .property-image {
      aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
      background: var(--soft);
    }

    .property-body {
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .property-kicker {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      color: var(--gold);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .12em;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .property h3 {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-size: 27px;
      line-height: 1.08;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    .property p {
      min-height: 54px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .property-meta {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 9px;
      color: #3d454d;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .property-meta span {
      padding: 7px 10px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #fafafa;
    }

    .split {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(340px, .72fr);
      gap: clamp(28px, 5vw, 76px);
      align-items: center;
      background: var(--night);
      color: var(--white);
    }

    .split .section {
      padding-right: 0;
    }

    .split h2 {
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      color: var(--white);
    }

    .split p {
      max-width: 620px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.72);
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .service-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 32px;
    }

    .service-item {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 48px 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
      align-items: start;
      padding-top: 18px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);
    }

    .service-item b {
      color: #d8c08b;
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-size: 25px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .service-item strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      color: var(--white);
    }

    .service-item span {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.66);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .split-image {
      min-height: 680px;
      align-self: stretch;
      background: var(--forest);
    }

    .contact-band {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .78fr) minmax(320px, .52fr);
      gap: clamp(30px, 5vw, 70px);
      align-items: start;
      background: var(--white);
    }

    .contact-copy p {
      max-width: 620px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .contact-form {
      padding: 28px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: #f8f6f1;
    }

    label {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: #2d3339;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: .08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    input, select, textarea {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 48px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      padding: 12px 13px;
      border: 1px solid #d5d2c9;
      border-radius: 6px;
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--ink);
      font: inherit;
    }

    textarea {
      min-height: 108px;
      resize: vertical;
    }

    .form-note {
      margin: 14px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .footer {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
      padding: 30px clamp(18px, 5vw, 64px);
      background: var(--night);
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.72);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .footer b {
      color: var(--white);
      letter-spacing: .12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .nav-links a:not(.btn) { display: none; }
      .metrics { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .properties { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .split, .contact-band { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .split .section { padding-right: clamp(18px, 5vw, 64px); }
      .split-image { min-height: 360px; order: -1; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .nav { min-height: 66px; padding: 14px 16px; }
      .brand { font-size: 11px; }
      .nav-links .btn { min-height: 40px; padding: 0 12px; font-size: 12px; }
      .hero { min-height: 86vh; }
      .hero-content { padding: 120px 16px 68px; }
      .hero-actions { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
      .metrics { grid-template-columns: 1fr; margin: 0; box-shadow: none; }
      .metric { min-height: 92px; }
      .section-head { display: block; }
      .section-head p { margin-top: 14px; }
      .contact-form { padding: 20px; }
      .footer { display: block; }
      .footer span { display: block; margin-top: 8px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="nav" aria-label="Navigation principale">
    <a class="brand" href="#">
      Maison Rivea
      <span>Immobilier prive</span>
    </a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#biens">Biens</a>
      <a href="#approche">Approche</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      <a class="btn btn-light" href="#contact">Demande privee</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <header class="hero">
    <div class="hero-media" aria-hidden="true">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2200&q=85" alt="">
    </div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="eyebrow">Cote d'Azur · biens confidentiels</div>
      <h1>Immobilier prive pour vies d'exception.</h1>
      <p>Maison Rivea accompagne acheteurs et vendeurs dans les transactions haut de gamme, avec une selection confidentielle et une approche sur mesure.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-light" href="#biens">Voir la selection</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href="#contact">Confier une recherche</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="metrics" aria-label="Chiffres cles">
    <div class="metric">
      <strong>42M€</strong>
      <span>de volume accompagne en transactions privees</span>
    </div>
    <div class="metric">
      <strong>18</strong>
      <span>biens off-market accessibles sur demande</span>
    </div>
    <div class="metric">
      <strong>7j</strong>
      <span>pour recevoir une selection qualifiee</span>
    </div>
    <div class="metric">
      <strong>100%</strong>
      <span>dossiers traites avec discretion</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <main>
    <section class="section" id="biens">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Une selection rare, pensee pour decider vite.</h2>
        <p>Chaque bien est presente avec les informations essentielles pour comprendre le potentiel, le standing et la coherence du prix.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="properties">
        <article class="property">
          <div class="property-image">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1613977257363-707ba9348227?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85" alt="Villa contemporaine avec piscine">
          </div>
          <div class="property-body">
            <div class="property-kicker"><span>Saint-Jean-Cap-Ferrat</span><span>6.9M€</span></div>
            <h3>Villa panorama mer</h3>
            <p>Architecture contemporaine, volumes ouverts, piscine miroir et vue Mediterranee depuis les pieces principales.</p>
            <div class="property-meta"><span>420 m2</span><span>5 suites</span><span>Off-market</span></div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="property">
          <div class="property-image">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600607687939-ce8a6c25118c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85" alt="Interieur elegant d'une residence premium">
          </div>
          <div class="property-body">
            <div class="property-kicker"><span>Cannes Californie</span><span>3.4M€</span></div>
            <h3>Penthouse lumineux</h3>
            <p>Dernier etage, terrasse profonde, prestations sobres et adresse recherchee pour residence principale ou secondaire.</p>
            <div class="property-meta"><span>186 m2</span><span>Terrasse</span><span>Garage double</span></div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="property">
          <div class="property-image">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600566753190-17f0baa2a6c3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85" alt="Maison de luxe avec piscine au coucher du soleil">
          </div>
          <div class="property-body">
            <div class="property-kicker"><span>Ramatuelle</span><span>8.2M€</span></div>
            <h3>Domaine confidentiel</h3>
            <p>Propriete au calme, jardin paysager, dependances et acces rapide aux plages les plus recherchees.</p>
            <div class="property-meta"><span>1.2 ha</span><span>7 chambres</span><span>Maison gardien</span></div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="split" id="approche">
      <div class="section">
        <div class="eyebrow">Approche privee</div>
        <h2>Moins de bruit. Plus de precision.</h2>
        <p>Les clients haut de gamme ne veulent pas parcourir cinquante annonces. Ils veulent une selection courte, lisible et credible. Maison Rivea filtre, structure et accompagne chaque decision avec une exigence de discretion.</p>

        <div class="service-list">
          <div class="service-item">
            <b>01</b>
            <div>
              <strong>Recherche qualifiee</strong>
              <span>Criteres precis, zone, budget, style de vie et contraintes reelles avant toute selection.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="service-item">
            <b>02</b>
            <div>
              <strong>Acces confidentiel</strong>
              <span>Biens publics et opportunites off-market presentes uniquement quand elles correspondent.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="service-item">
            <b>03</b>
            <div>
              <strong>Decision accompagnee</strong>
              <span>Analyse du positionnement, marge de negociation et points de vigilance avant l'offre.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="split-image" aria-hidden="true">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600607687920-4e2a09cf159d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85" alt="">
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section contact-band" id="contact">
      <div class="contact-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow">Demande confidentielle</div>
        <h2>Recevoir une selection privee.</h2>
        <p>Indiquez votre projet, votre zone et votre budget. Un conseiller revient vers vous avec une premiere lecture du marche et les opportunites pertinentes.</p>
      </div>

      <form class="contact-form">
        <label for="name">Nom</label>
        <input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="Votre nom">

        <label for="project">Projet</label>
        <select id="project" name="project">
          <option>Acquisition residence principale</option>
          <option>Residence secondaire</option>
          <option>Investissement patrimonial</option>
          <option>Vente confidentielle</option>
        </select>

        <label for="budget">Budget</label>
        <input id="budget" name="budget" type="text" placeholder="Ex : 2M€ - 5M€">

        <label for="message">Details</label>
        <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Zone recherchee, delai, criteres importants..."></textarea>

        <button class="btn btn-dark" type="button">Envoyer la demande</button>
        <p class="form-note">Demo portfolio : le formulaire n'envoie pas encore de message.</p>
      </form>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer">
    <b>Maison Rivea</b>
    <span>Demo de site premium pour professionnels de l'immobilier haut de gamme.</span>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
